  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>The dimensional form of velocity can be written as</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mi>v</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><msup><mi>&#955;</mi><mi>a</mi></msup><msup><mi>g</mi><mi>b</mi></msup><msup><mi>&#961;</mi><mi>c</mi></msup></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><msup><mi>M</mi><mn>0</mn></msup><mi>L</mi><msup><mi>T</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mi>L</mi></mfenced><mi>a</mi></msup><msup><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mi>L</mi><msup><mi>T</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced><mi>b</mi></msup><msup><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mi>M</mi><msup><mi>L</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced><mi>c</mi></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"></math>Comparing the exponents for&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>M</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>L</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>T</mi></math>,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>For</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>M</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><msup><mi>M</mi><mi>c</mi></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>M</mi><mn>0</mn></msup><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><mi>For</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>L</mi><mo>,</mo><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><msup><mi>L</mi><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>c</mi></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>L</mi><mn>1</mn></msup><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><mi>For</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>T</mi><mo>,</mo><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><msup><mi>T</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>b</mi></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>T</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math></p><p>So,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo>)</mo><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>(</mo><mi>i</mi><mi>i</mi><mo>)</mo><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>(</mo><mi>i</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>i</mi><mo>)</mo></math></p><p>From equations (i),(ii),(iii),</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p>&nbsp;</p></blockquote>",
